// Adapted from 最终齐文化典籍中心最终版方案_260105.pdf.
// Page numbers refer to physical PDF pages; IDs follow the supplied photo folders.
export const exhibitContent = [
 {id:'lobby',title:['天齐渊','Tianqiyuan'],zone:['前厅','Lobby'],pages:[41],
  text:['将“天齐渊”的宇宙观融入空间，以模拟自然光效复刻一日四时的光影变化，呈现齐文化贯通古今的时间意象。大厅中央以典籍为“地”、光影为“天”，共同营造“天人合一”的叙事场域。','方案通过双层透光膜与高反光材质，让自然与人工光效交织，呼应“顺天应时，通变创新”的精神内核。'],
  en:['The lobby translates the cosmological imagery of Tianqiyuan into space. Simulated daylight follows the changing light of a day, connecting the continuity of Qi culture with the passage of time. Books form the “earth” and light the “sky” within a shared narrative setting.','The proposal combines a double-layer translucent ceiling with reflective materials, bringing natural and artificial light together to express harmony between people and nature.']},
 {id:'preface',title:['齐之为齐','What makes Qi, Qi'],zone:['序厅','Preface hall'],pages:[62],
  text:['何为“齐”？展项以三部典籍的记载为线索，通过多面立体投影勾勒“齐”字，借助三个镜面方形结构，分别演绎“齐”的三种源起。','镜面之间相互映射，形成无限延展的空间幻境。单面镜使观众得以窥见内部反射的层次，在文字、影像与虚实交织的空间中进入齐文化的叙事。'],
  en:['What does “Qi” mean? Accounts from three classical texts guide the opening experience. Multi-surface projection traces the character Qi, while three mirrored structures present three accounts of its origins.','Reflections extend the imagery into an apparently infinite space. One-way mirrors reveal layers of reflected light, introducing visitors to Qi culture through text, moving images and spatial illusion.']},
 {id:'01',title:['因其俗，简其礼','Adapt customs, simplify rites'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[68],
  text:['以《史记·鲁周公世家》为蓝本，呈现姜太公入齐后面对部落纷争、建立秩序并赢得民心的过程。12 米长、4.2 米高的 LED 巨幕将观众带入齐文化形成的重要节点。','展项以“更其俗、革其礼”与“因其俗、简其礼”的不同选择构成叩问。观众在行进与交互中思考治国方式，让历史叙事转化为与当下观众的对话。'],
  en:['Based on the Records of the Grand Historian, this exhibit follows Jiang Taigong’s arrival in Qi, his response to conflict, and his efforts to establish order and win public support. A 12-metre-wide, 4.2-metre-high LED screen sets the scene.','The experience contrasts imposing new customs with adapting to existing traditions and simplifying rites. Movement and interaction invite visitors to consider these choices, turning a historical account into a question for the present.']},
 {id:'02',title:['人民多归齐','People gather in Qi'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[76,81],
  text:['从齐地盐碱土壤、人口稀少的困境出发，讲述姜太公因地制宜，发展渔盐与商工，进而吸引人口汇聚的过程。《史记》与《汉书》的记载共同串联起齐国改革与兴盛的线索。','方案将人口与资源的流动转化为汇聚的光线：由海岱之间的细流，到周边诸侯国的光带，再到齐国核心区域，呈现“人民多归齐，齐为大国”的发展图景。'],
  en:['The story begins with saline land and a sparse population. Jiang Taigong responds to local conditions by developing salt, fishing, trade and industry, attracting people to Qi. Accounts in the Records of the Grand Historian and the Book of Han connect these reforms with the state’s growth.','The proposal visualises movement as converging light: fine streams from nearby settlements become brighter bands arriving from neighbouring states, gathering around Qi’s centres of population and resources.']},
 {id:'03',title:['一乘者有食','Hospitality for merchants'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[83],
  text:['以《管子·轻重乙》中“为诸侯之商贾立客舍”的记载为核心，呈现齐国接待外来商旅、促进贸易往来的开放政策。','竹简造型阵列环绕排列，暖黄色光粒如商路灯火般流动，伴随铜铃与马蹄声，营造商贾云集的氛围。“一乘者有食，三乘者有刍菽，五乘者有伍养”的典籍文字成为空间叙事的线索。'],
  en:['The exhibit draws on the Guanzi account of establishing guesthouses for visiting merchants. It presents hospitality as part of Qi’s policy of encouraging trade and exchange.','An array of bamboo-slip forms surrounds visitors. Warm particles of light, bells and hoofbeats evoke busy trade routes, while passages describing provisions for merchants and their transport anchor the spatial narrative.']},
 {id:'04',title:['九合诸侯','The assembly of rulers'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[89],
  text:['以“九合诸侯，不以兵车”为叙事核心，呈现齐桓公会盟诸侯的历史场景，讲述外交智慧与仁政理念。','三折幕以 U 型环绕排布，通过影像、典籍片段与礼乐，将“葵丘之盟”“召陵之盟”“首止之盟”等历史事件转化为可身临其境的观看体验。'],
  en:['Centred on convening rulers without relying on military force, the exhibit recounts Duke Huan of Qi’s alliances and explores diplomacy and benevolent government.','Three screens form a U-shaped setting. Moving images, ritual music and passages from classical texts place visitors within the historical assemblies at Kuiqiu, Shaoling and Shouzhi.']},
 {id:'05',title:['齐事成语','Stories and idioms of Qi'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[99],
  text:['从《韩非子》等典籍中选取“老马识途”“滥竽充数”“狡兔三窟”等齐地成语，将熟悉的语言转化为可触、可感的填字游戏。','观众在触控屏上书写汉字，补全墙面屏幕中的成语，并获得对应的故事解释。双屏交互让典籍阅读融入参与过程，也为研学活动提供入口。'],
  en:['Familiar idioms associated with Qi, including stories of the old horse finding the way, the unqualified musician and the rabbit’s three burrows, become interactive word puzzles drawn from texts such as Han Feizi.','Visitors write missing characters on a touchscreen to complete an idiom on the wall display and reveal its story. The paired screens turn reading into participation and support educational visits.']},
 {id:'06',title:['晏子说','A conversation with Yan Zi'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[104],
  text:['以《晏子春秋》中晏婴与叔向“意孰为高？行孰为厚？”的对话为基础，通过数字人技术再现古代思想交流的情境。','展项围绕“意莫高于爱民，行莫厚于乐民”展开，以人物与具体叙事解释“以民为本”的治国理念，传达齐文化惠民、乐民的务实传统。'],
  en:['A digital character brings to life the dialogue between Yan Ying and Shuxiang recorded in the Annals of Master Yan: what is the highest intention, and what is the most generous conduct?','The response places care for people and their wellbeing at the centre of government. Character-based storytelling makes this practical, people-centred tradition of Qi culture accessible to visitors.']},
 {id:'07',title:['孔子适齐','Confucius visits Qi'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[108],
  text:['通过直径 2 米的灯箱呈现《孔子圣迹图·在齐闻韶》与《孔子圣迹图·晏婴沮封》两幅古画，将孔子在齐的经历转化为可观看的历史场景。','画面配合高保真韶乐，呼应孔子“三月不知肉味”的记载，呈现诸子时代思想交流的开放格局。'],
  en:['A two-metre-diameter lightbox presents two paintings from the Illustrated Life of Confucius: hearing Shao music in Qi, and Yan Ying opposing a grant of land. Together they introduce episodes from Confucius’s visit.','High-fidelity Shao music accompanies the paintings, recalling the account that Confucius forgot the taste of meat for three months and highlighting the period’s openness to intellectual exchange.']},
 {id:'08',title:['面刺寡人之过','Speaking truth to the king'],zone:['第一单元 · 泱泱齐风','Unit 01 · The Spirit of Qi'],pages:[112,115],
  text:['以《战国策》为核心文本，通过环绕影像构建齐威王悬赏纳谏、门庭若市的历史场景。','方案以宫廷沉溺、君王醒悟与广开言路的戏剧转折组织观看节奏，让观众在沉浸式叙事中理解包容不同意见、听取谏言的意义。'],
  en:['Drawing on Strategies of the Warring States, surrounding imagery recreates King Wei of Qi’s invitation to criticism and the crowds that came to offer advice.','The proposed sequence moves from courtly distraction to the ruler’s awakening and an opening to counsel. Its dramatic progression explores the value of listening to different opinions.']},
 {id:'09',title:['康庄之衢','The Broad Thoroughfare'],zone:['第二单元 · 康庄之衢','Unit 02 · The Broad Thoroughfare'],pages:[119],
  text:['以《战国策》笔下临淄“车毂击，人肩摩”的繁盛景象为叙事内容，把层间通道转化为穿越齐都的旅程。市井人流、举袂成幕的衣袖与挥汗成雨的意象，共同描绘城市的活力。','稷下学宫的生活片段沿途展开：学子围坐而食、倚窗小憩、推演学问。荀子、孟子与邹衍的日常，使抽象的思想空间成为可以感知的生活场景。'],
  en:['The passage between floors becomes a journey through the prosperous capital of Linzi described in Strategies of the Warring States. Crowded streets, raised sleeves and bustling movement communicate the city’s energy.','Episodes of everyday life at the Jixia Academy unfold along the route: scholars eating together, resting by a window and debating ideas. Scenes involving Xunzi, Mencius and Zou Yan make an intellectual institution tangible through daily life.']},
 {id:'10',title:['典籍阅读区','Classics reading'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[127],
  text:['以“远—中—近”三个层次组织典籍陈列：远望感受群书阵列的规模，中观辨认镶嵌于墙面的卷帙，近览则通过抽屉与屏幕参与阅读。','拉开屉匣，观众看到古代学子伏案读解、论辩思索的情景。展项把“观书”转化为“入书”，以探索和发现的方式拉近人与典籍的距离。'],
  en:['The display is organised at three viewing distances: the scale of the collection from afar, individual volumes embedded in the wall at mid-range, and interactive drawers and screens up close.','Opening a drawer reveals scholars reading, interpreting and debating. Discovery turns looking at books into entering their world, creating a more personal encounter with classical texts.']},
 {id:'11',title:['古今诵读区','Reading across time'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[134],
  text:['以“穿越式齐诵”为核心体验，由荀子形象领诵，通过数字技术让古今学子同席共读，营造稷下学宫的学习氛围。','跨越时空的诵读声将观众带入集体阅读场景，为学校、家长与学生提供共同参与的典籍体验，连接古代智慧与当代教育。'],
  en:['A figure of Xunzi leads a shared reading across time. Digital imagery brings ancient and contemporary students together, evoking the learning environment of the Jixia Academy.','Voices from different periods surround visitors in a collective reading experience. Designed for schools, families and young people, the exhibit connects classical learning with education today.']},
 {id:'12',title:['诸子时代','The age of philosophers'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[139],
  text:['融合诸子时代的典籍文献、轴心时代的地理信息与典籍数据，通过可视化形成多维时空图谱。','异形灯光模组构成阵列，以暖色光影呈现百家思想的流变与地域分布，结合地面实景，建立自然与人文之间的对话。'],
  en:['Classical texts, geographical information from the Axial Age and textual data are combined into a multidimensional map of ideas across time and place.','An array of shaped lighting modules uses warm light to express the development and distribution of philosophical schools. Ground-level scenery connects the intellectual landscape with the natural world.']},
 {id:'13',title:['齐风民俗','Folk traditions of Qi'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[143],
  text:['以《诗经》为文化内核，将齐地生活与礼俗转化为可阅读的场景。方案围绕外交辩论、田猎逐兽与婚俗体验三个主题展开。','从晏子应对楚王的语言智慧，到《还》篇的狩猎场面与《著》篇的婚仪，典籍文字、礼器与场景共同呈现古人的日常、情感及礼制。'],
  en:['The Book of Songs provides the cultural basis for scenes of life and customs in Qi. The proposal develops three themes: diplomatic debate, hunting and wedding rituals.','Yan Zi’s verbal ingenuity, the hunting scenes of Huan and the wedding imagery of Zhu connect classical passages with objects and settings, revealing everyday life, emotion and ritual.']},
 {id:'14',title:['一印千年','Impressions across time'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[147],
  text:['将《齐书总目》收录的典籍、人物与故事转化为风格统一的篆刻印章，邀请观众以盖印的方式重构齐地历史。','观众选择感兴趣的名称、主题或故事，盖印在自己的“齐书”册页中并装订带走。选择与编排让被动阅读成为主动编纂，也让每份纪念册成为个人的文化记忆。'],
  en:['Texts, figures and stories listed in the catalogue of Qi writings are translated into a family of carved seals. Visitors reconstruct their own account of Qi’s history through stamping.','They select names, ideas or stories, print them on the pages of a personal book and bind it to take away. Choosing and arranging the impressions turns reading into authorship and creates an individual cultural keepsake.']},
 {id:'15',title:['孙子兵法','The Art of War'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[152],
  text:['方案以混合现实构建战国场景：观众登上复刻战船，进入由孙武、楚王与楚军视角组成的平行时空。','《孙子兵法》十三篇的策略与瓦当纹饰建立对应，观众通过选择制定应对方案，并看到判断带来的不同结果。第一视角同步投影，使旁观者也能共同见证决策过程。'],
  en:['The proposal uses mixed reality to create a Warring States setting. Visitors board a replica warship and encounter parallel scenes from the perspectives of Sun Wu, the king of Chu and the Chu army.','Strategies from the thirteen chapters of The Art of War are paired with roof-tile motifs. Visitors choose a response and experience its consequences, while a live first-person projection allows others to follow the decisions.']},
 {id:'16',title:['甘石星经','The star catalogue of Gan and Shi'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[157],
  text:['通过立体星图与动态光点，呈现《甘石星经》记载的 120 颗恒星方位，并以五大行星运行的可视化展示古人的天文观测。','星象、数字影像与装置共同构成仰望苍穹的体验，引导观众理解观天测地的智慧，以及“天人合一”的宇宙观与自然哲学。'],
  en:['A three-dimensional star map and moving points of light present the positions of 120 stars recorded in the Gan-Shi star catalogue. Visualisations of the five planets introduce early astronomical observation.','Celestial imagery, digital media and installation form an experience of looking into the sky, exploring the relationship between observation, natural philosophy and the idea of harmony between humanity and the cosmos.']},
 {id:'17',title:['医脉千年','A millennium of medicine'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[165],
  text:['以贯穿展厅的长卷呈现《史记·扁鹊仓公列传》与《天回医简》的内容，梳理扁鹊的医学思想与历史贡献。','方案将墙面的图文叙事与淳于意所记录的 25 篇“诊籍”相互对照，通过典籍、病例与艺术表达，让观众在安静的阅读中理解医学知识的积累与传承。'],
  en:['A continuous illustrated scroll draws on the biographies of Bian Que and Cang Gong in the Records of the Grand Historian and the Tianhui medical manuscripts, introducing Bian Que’s ideas and contributions.','Wall-based interpretation is paired with the 25 case records attributed to Chunyu Yi. Texts, cases and artistic presentation create a quiet setting for considering how medical knowledge is accumulated and transmitted.']},
 {id:'18',title:['考工记 · 齐民要术','Craft and agriculture classics'],zone:['第三单元 · 皇皇史册','Unit 03 · The Historical Record'],pages:[168],
  text:['利用二层环形回廊的采光与流动性，将《考工记》的合金实践、建城推演以及《齐民要术》的农业智慧组织为连续的交互视窗。','内容嵌入墙体，在保持通道宽敞的同时形成有节奏的展陈。观众沿回廊行进，在不同窗口驻足，通过参与理解典籍中的技术与生活智慧。'],
  en:['The bright circular corridor on the second floor connects interactive windows on alloy-making and city planning from the Kaogong Ji with agricultural knowledge from the Qimin Yaoshu.','Embedding the content in the walls keeps the passage open and establishes a visual rhythm. Visitors pause at individual windows to explore the technical and practical knowledge preserved in these texts.']},
 {id:'19',title:['百工传薪','Crafts across generations'],zone:['第四单元 · 贯烁古今','Unit 04 · Across Past and Present'],pages:[174],
  text:['灯箱与 LED 屏幕组成多重阵列，营造记录淄博百年工业发展的“时光长廊”。两侧以经过修复的老工厂照片呈现机器、工厂与劳动者。','中央动态影像将历史照片与文字记载、工艺传承及现代产业联系起来，使地方工业记忆与当代城市发展形成呼应。'],
  en:['Arrays of lightboxes and LED screens form a corridor through a century of Zibo’s industrial history. Restored photographs on either side show factories, machinery and the people at work.','Central moving imagery connects these photographs with written accounts, craft traditions and contemporary industries, placing local industrial memory in dialogue with the city today.']},
 {id:'20',title:['聊斋魔盒','Liaozhai magic box'],zone:['第四单元 · 贯烁古今','Unit 04 · Across Past and Present'],pages:[191],
  text:['以书房、笔墨与《聊斋志异》手稿营造蒲松龄的创作氛围，书案上的“魔盒”以古代书匣为造型，成为进入故事的入口。','观众开启魔盒，即随机触发《聂小倩》《青凤》《画皮》等故事片段。动画、影像与书法关键词相互配合，将阅读转化为一次主动开启的奇幻叙事。'],
  en:['A study furnished with writing tools and manuscripts evokes Pu Songling’s creative world. A “magic box”, shaped like a traditional book case, becomes the entrance to Strange Tales from a Chinese Studio.','Opening the box triggers a randomly selected episode from stories such as Nie Xiaoqian, Qingfeng or Painted Skin. Animation, imagery and calligraphic keywords turn reading into a fantastical narrative initiated by the visitor.']},
 {id:'21',title:['齐国蹴鞠','Cuju in Qi'],zone:['第四单元 · 贯烁古今','Unit 04 · Across Past and Present'],pages:[180],
  text:['根据典籍记载重现古代蹴鞠场景，观众可自由组队，选择“齐国明星”作为队友或对手，进入共同竞技的情境。','Kinect 体感技术捕捉颠球、传球等动作并转化为数字指令，同步显示在屏幕中，让身体参与成为理解传统体育的方式。'],
  en:['Classical accounts inform a recreation of the ancient ball game cuju. Visitors form teams and choose figures from Qi as teammates or opponents.','Kinect motion sensing translates movements such as keeping the ball up and passing into on-screen actions. Physical participation becomes a way to encounter the history of sport.']},
 {id:'22',title:['烧烤特色区','Local barbecue culture'],zone:['第四单元 · 贯烁古今','Unit 04 · Across Past and Present'],pages:[184,185],
  text:['二层临窗的明亮区域被组织为轻松的互动体验区。方案将“淄博烧烤”积木拼搭与琉璃、丝绸工艺 DIY 联系起来，让观众通过手作认识地方生活与传统技艺。','对面的影像以淄博烧烤为切入口，展示当代淄博人的生活态度与城市精神。参与、手作与文化呈现共同构成参观尾段的日常体验。'],
  en:['A bright area beside the second-floor windows offers a relaxed interactive experience. The proposal connects Zibo barbecue-themed building blocks with glass and silk craft activities, introducing local life and traditional processes through making.','An opposite screen uses barbecue culture as an entry point into contemporary Zibo’s attitudes and urban identity. Participation, craft and moving imagery bring the visit back to everyday life.']}
];
